(3152543, 442589, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love this image. The clean white background works very well. I think the amount of negative space helps with the zen sense and feeling of focus on the rocks. I love the the reflection of each rock on top of another, and the feeling of the top one floating. The duotone is an interesting idea. The one thing I can''t get over with this image is that it looks so similar to a photo I submitted to this challenge. Anyways, rock on!</td>', 'Love this image. The clean white background works very well. I think the amount of negative space helps with the zen sense and feeling of focus on the rocks. I love the the reflection of each rock on top of another, and the feeling of the top one floating. The duotone is an interesting idea. The one thing I can''t get over with this image is that it looks so similar to a photo I submitted to this challenge. Anyways, rock on!', '2006-12-27 05:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
