(3153090, 442501, 63398, '<td valign="top">I hate you!!!!! 8&gt;) I wanted to find a spiderweb ''cause for the last few days it''s been raining and it would have been perfect like this had I found one. BUT.....it''s winter here and no insects for the spiders, therefore.....no webs! So I''m not giving you a 10 out of sheer jealousy! 9! I love the water droplets on the spider, too!</td>', 'I hate you!!!!! 8>) I wanted to find a spiderweb ''cause for the last few days it''s been raining and it would have been perfect like this had I found one. BUT.....it''s winter here and no insects for the spiders, therefore.....no webs! So I''m not giving you a 10 out of sheer jealousy! 9! I love the water droplets on the spider, too!', '2006-12-27 09:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
