(3154522, 442694, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great choice for a pattern.  Would have been even nicer if you made the strawberry the least bit appetizing.  Using an adjustment layer (selective color) and the selecting the red tab...you could increase the red content in the stawberry and then selecting the green you could have fixed teh leaves on it.  And it''s all legal under basic editing.  I like how you have a nice clear focus.</td>', 'Great choice for a pattern.  Would have been even nicer if you made the strawberry the least bit appetizing.  Using an adjustment layer (selective color) and the selecting the red tab...you could increase the red content in the stawberry and then selecting the green you could have fixed teh leaves on it.  And it''s all legal under basic editing.  I like how you have a nice clear focus.', '2006-12-27 19:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
