(3154994, 441856, 67841, '<td valign="top">I love the composition &amp; the tones present in the outer edges, but I wish there wasn''t such a disparity in exposures.  The center would be so much nicer stopped down much further - this would be a great candidate for HDR!  The colors present in the middle circle  just don''t jive well with the rest of the image - in fact it looks like tons of CA to me.<br/> <br/>The unusual border is...well, unusual.  Not sure if I like it or not, I think it might detract overall.  This is a bold image though...  &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'I love the composition & the tones present in the outer edges, but I wish there wasn''t such a disparity in exposures.  The center would be so much nicer stopped down much further - this would be a great candidate for HDR!  The colors present in the middle circle  just don''t jive well with the rest of the image - in fact it looks like tons of CA to me. The unusual border is...well, unusual.  Not sure if I like it or not, I think it might detract overall.  This is a bold image though...  << 7 >>', '2006-12-28 00:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
