(3155005, 442581, 67841, '<td valign="top">Love the muted tones here - the thumbnail is a real interest grabber &amp; the full size doesn''t disappoint!  A hair more saturation &amp; contrast would have tickled my fancy, though - y''know, bring out some of the lovely tones that can be found in rust shots.  I like the choice in composition &amp; crop - &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Love the muted tones here - the thumbnail is a real interest grabber & the full size doesn''t disappoint!  A hair more saturation & contrast would have tickled my fancy, though - y''know, bring out some of the lovely tones that can be found in rust shots.  I like the choice in composition & crop - << 7 >>', '2006-12-28 00:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
