(3155020, 442878, 67841, '<td valign="top">Great choice in subject, but I think the execution is a bit faulty.  We''re off-center, but only enough to make it feel like it wasn''t intentional; focus is slightly off or the image is just plain soft overall; image is lacking in contrast &amp; dynamic range even though there''s plenty of it there potentially; that bit of red in the bottom row is bothersome &amp; I would have composed differently or cropped it out.<br/> <br/>IMHO, this really could have been an awesome entry had it been carried out better!</td>', 'Great choice in subject, but I think the execution is a bit faulty.  We''re off-center, but only enough to make it feel like it wasn''t intentional; focus is slightly off or the image is just plain soft overall; image is lacking in contrast & dynamic range even though there''s plenty of it there potentially; that bit of red in the bottom row is bothersome & I would have composed differently or cropped it out. IMHO, this really could have been an awesome entry had it been carried out better!', '2006-12-28 00:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155026, 442864, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but more texture &amp; modeling would have gotten you a lot more mileage with this one!</td>', 'Nicely composed, but more texture & modeling would have gotten you a lot more mileage with this one!', '2006-12-28 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155031, 442257, 67841, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image that could have benefited greatly by some different choices in cropping, IMHO.  I would have concentrated our attention on the great potential for symmetry here by cropping out most of the bottom, a bit more from the top &amp; some from the sides with a bit more from the right- enough to get rid of that overblown top right corner plus bring that strong vertical line right down the middle.</td>', 'This is a nice image that could have benefited greatly by some different choices in cropping, IMHO.  I would have concentrated our attention on the great potential for symmetry here by cropping out most of the bottom, a bit more from the top & some from the sides with a bit more from the right- enough to get rid of that overblown top right corner plus bring that strong vertical line right down the middle.', '2006-12-28 01:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155032, 442020, 66201, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this idea....this is warm, and very much a pattern. It also has the interest factor which a lot of the Pattern entries don''t (very abstract and clinical). BUT I am struggling to find the focal point in this. Did you struggle with low light and DOF?</td>', 'I LOVE this idea....this is warm, and very much a pattern. It also has the interest factor which a lot of the Pattern entries don''t (very abstract and clinical). BUT I am struggling to find the focal point in this. Did you struggle with low light and DOF?', '2006-12-28 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
