(3155257, 442477, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed &amp; great subject, but I don''t think you did the image any favors by boosting the colors like you did - those blues are downright annoying  (but maybe this was a UV shot...) <br/> <br/>If this was an IR/UV, then I think it would have been better served by bringing some of the bottom end back in &amp; creating some dynamic range in luminance while possibly dialing back the sat just a skosh.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nicely composed & great subject, but I don''t think you did the image any favors by boosting the colors like you did - those blues are downright annoying  (but maybe this was a UV shot...)  If this was an IR/UV, then I think it would have been better served by bringing some of the bottom end back in & creating some dynamic range in luminance while possibly dialing back the sat just a skosh. << 6 >>', '2006-12-28 03:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155266, 442879, 67841, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is a nice choice here -- I would have tweaked the channels first to get some more texture overall --  Could use a bit more on the sharpness end, too...</td>', 'B&W is a nice choice here -- I would have tweaked the channels first to get some more texture overall --  Could use a bit more on the sharpness end, too...', '2006-12-28 03:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
