(3160576, 442403, 5746, '<td valign="top">Lovely creatures. They pose like for the Vogue. Great detail. I can''t take my eyes of the white creature. Very unusual idea for this challenge. 10.</td>', 'Lovely creatures. They pose like for the Vogue. Great detail. I can''t take my eyes of the white creature. Very unusual idea for this challenge. 10.', '2006-12-29 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
