(3163346, 442183, 15511, '<td valign="top">This photo intrigues me; I like detail oriented visual images. Perhaps the contrast could be more extreme, as in the whites could be whiter, and the blacks could be darker. It''s unfortunate that the limits of the rules prevent me from enjoying this image in a larger scale. Please identify this location in your notes.</td>', 'This photo intrigues me; I like detail oriented visual images. Perhaps the contrast could be more extreme, as in the whites could be whiter, and the blacks could be darker. It''s unfortunate that the limits of the rules prevent me from enjoying this image in a larger scale. Please identify this location in your notes.', '2006-12-30 22:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3163350, 442657, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great effort! I like the way the pasta makes patterns on the red plate. The blue background make this a very appealing photo. Lighting and focus is great!</td>', 'Great effort! I like the way the pasta makes patterns on the red plate. The blue background make this a very appealing photo. Lighting and focus is great!', '2006-12-30 22:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
