(3164655, 441319, 16197, '<td valign="top">I had a near similar image several years ago here.  and sadly, Even though then I disagreed with some of the comments I will have to repeat them.  Seeing on how I am assuming the pattern of the fence is your main subject, I would have liked to see great more detail in the fence itself, and less on the animal behind.<br/> <br/>I do like the crop and the pose, but I also think it could use a bit of levels adjustment.</td>', 'I had a near similar image several years ago here.  and sadly, Even though then I disagreed with some of the comments I will have to repeat them.  Seeing on how I am assuming the pattern of the fence is your main subject, I would have liked to see great more detail in the fence itself, and less on the animal behind. I do like the crop and the pose, but I also think it could use a bit of levels adjustment.', '2006-12-31 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
