(3169493, 442678, 38032, '<td valign="top">Those look like military rockets or something - Interesting subjects - There''s something needed here - I think the composition could use some help and the character walking seems to be carrying something - as if there might be a story there but there aren''t enough pieces to the puzzle to get started.  Not that it''s possible but do this:  just sprint to the other side, lay on the ground and point the camera up - including the woman''s face and the ... 4 bowling balls she''s carrying along with a more ground-up perspective on the rockets - no problem right? ;)</td>', 'Those look like military rockets or something - Interesting subjects - There''s something needed here - I think the composition could use some help and the character walking seems to be carrying something - as if there might be a story there but there aren''t enough pieces to the puzzle to get started.  Not that it''s possible but do this:  just sprint to the other side, lay on the ground and point the camera up - including the woman''s face and the ... 4 bowling balls she''s carrying along with a more ground-up perspective on the rockets - no problem right? ;)', '2007-01-02 07:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
