(3169859, 442782, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using the photo sideways (I like photographs that help me to see common things in new ways), but I was distracted by the patterns within the stairs and the railing (the wood, the dirt, the wear), so that -- to my eyes -- the pattern itself was more lost than emphasized.</td>', 'I like the idea of using the photo sideways (I like photographs that help me to see common things in new ways), but I was distracted by the patterns within the stairs and the railing (the wood, the dirt, the wear), so that -- to my eyes -- the pattern itself was more lost than emphasized.', '2007-01-02 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169863, 442191, 43073, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but the colors seem a bit too subtle, which to me de-emphasized the overall pattern a bit too much.</td>', 'A nice image, but the colors seem a bit too subtle, which to me de-emphasized the overall pattern a bit too much.', '2007-01-02 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169864, 442481, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, nicely cropped, and the "sameness" of the windows establishes the pattern quite nicely.</td>', 'I like this shot, nicely cropped, and the "sameness" of the windows establishes the pattern quite nicely.', '2007-01-02 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169868, 442565, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, and I understand that there are patterns in nature everywhere you look, but it seems as though it''s completely left to the viewer to find whichever pattern he or she wants (in the trees? on the beach? the reflection of the far hill on the water?).</td>', 'This is a nice image, and I understand that there are patterns in nature everywhere you look, but it seems as though it''s completely left to the viewer to find whichever pattern he or she wants (in the trees? on the beach? the reflection of the far hill on the water?).', '2007-01-02 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169870, 441387, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t do much for me; it''s technically well done, though I think a bit more saturation or perhaps contrast in the final image might have enhanced it for me.</td>', 'This image doesn''t do much for me; it''s technically well done, though I think a bit more saturation or perhaps contrast in the final image might have enhanced it for me.', '2007-01-02 09:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169872, 442946, 43073, '<td valign="top">I see the pattern, and there''s nice use of depth of field here, but the subject matter isn''t particularly interesting to me.</td>', 'I see the pattern, and there''s nice use of depth of field here, but the subject matter isn''t particularly interesting to me.', '2007-01-02 09:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169877, 442639, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, with excellent depth of field and use of natural light. Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice image, with excellent depth of field and use of natural light. Nicely done!', '2007-01-02 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169883, 442457, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really excellent image, great colors, and nice breaking up of the patterns (the net and below the net) with the marble.</td>', 'Really excellent image, great colors, and nice breaking up of the patterns (the net and below the net) with the marble.', '2007-01-02 09:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169885, 441788, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this image; it takes nice advantage of the falling of the light to imply additional patterns and double the pattern of the windows. Well done!</td>', 'I like this image; it takes nice advantage of the falling of the light to imply additional patterns and double the pattern of the windows. Well done!', '2007-01-02 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169927, 442906, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good image with good subject matter, but I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast (perhaps in color) among the stones, or the use of light to enhance the overall image. Some of the stones are a bit overexposed (on the right and in the upper right especially), and some post-processing may have helped this and given more impact to the photo! I do like it, though.</td>', 'Good image with good subject matter, but I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast (perhaps in color) among the stones, or the use of light to enhance the overall image. Some of the stones are a bit overexposed (on the right and in the upper right especially), and some post-processing may have helped this and given more impact to the photo! I do like it, though.', '2007-01-02 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169930, 442726, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like your use of color here, but something about it doesn''t work for me; the flowers (grass?) don''t seem to be sharply in focus, and the background (waves, etc.) aren''t either, so I''m not always sure where I''m supposed to be looking.</td>', 'I like your use of color here, but something about it doesn''t work for me; the flowers (grass?) don''t seem to be sharply in focus, and the background (waves, etc.) aren''t either, so I''m not always sure where I''m supposed to be looking.', '2007-01-02 10:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169935, 442396, 43073, '<td valign="top">This looks like a technically well done photo, but the subject matter doesn''t do it for me, especially that I don''t see much of a pattern in the balls themselves, and the dots on each are distracting to me in a way that I don''t think was intended (some balls have them, others don''t, there are different numbers on different balls). I''m definitely picking nits with this, but it''s how it strucke me!</td>', 'This looks like a technically well done photo, but the subject matter doesn''t do it for me, especially that I don''t see much of a pattern in the balls themselves, and the dots on each are distracting to me in a way that I don''t think was intended (some balls have them, others don''t, there are different numbers on different balls). I''m definitely picking nits with this, but it''s how it strucke me!', '2007-01-02 10:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169953, 441254, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, but the subject matter does not do much for me; I see these the way I see gifts every day, and the patterns of the gift wrap and their placement are there, but not different in a way that I would expect from an image focused on patterns.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, but the subject matter does not do much for me; I see these the way I see gifts every day, and the patterns of the gift wrap and their placement are there, but not different in a way that I would expect from an image focused on patterns.', '2007-01-02 10:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169958, 441829, 43073, '<td valign="top">Glass Christmas ornaments are difficult to photograph (the reflection in the main ball is distracting for me), but this is a good shot. I would have liked to have seen more depth of field here to emphasize the pattern itself (created by the balls themselves).</td>', 'Glass Christmas ornaments are difficult to photograph (the reflection in the main ball is distracting for me), but this is a good shot. I would have liked to have seen more depth of field here to emphasize the pattern itself (created by the balls themselves).', '2007-01-02 10:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169963, 442648, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, nice use of depth of field and the subject matter fits nicely with the challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot, nice use of depth of field and the subject matter fits nicely with the challenge.', '2007-01-02 10:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169972, 442475, 43073, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me; the contrast is a bit muted, some of the spines are too bright, and some of the titles are lost while others are not. The pattern for me is common place, but I don''t see it here any differently than I do on my own CD rack (I''m looking to see things differently in photographs rather than just what I see each day).</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me; the contrast is a bit muted, some of the spines are too bright, and some of the titles are lost while others are not. The pattern for me is common place, but I don''t see it here any differently than I do on my own CD rack (I''m looking to see things differently in photographs rather than just what I see each day).', '2007-01-02 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169978, 442494, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat patterns, nicely photographed, but I think I would have preferred a closer shot, without the greens in the background (to focus more on the pattern, which is pretty neat).</td>', 'Neat patterns, nicely photographed, but I think I would have preferred a closer shot, without the greens in the background (to focus more on the pattern, which is pretty neat).', '2007-01-02 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169980, 442649, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well photographed (I like that most (all?) of the image is in focus), nice contrast in lighting.</td>', 'Very nice shot, well photographed (I like that most (all?) of the image is in focus), nice contrast in lighting.', '2007-01-02 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169988, 441092, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, and definitely focused on the pattern, but being "made of light" it all seems a bit overwhelming to me (maybe that was the point?).</td>', 'Interesting image, and definitely focused on the pattern, but being "made of light" it all seems a bit overwhelming to me (maybe that was the point?).', '2007-01-02 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169996, 442966, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good lighting highlighting the skin tones, and I like the choice to go in black and white (which I think most likely emphasized the pattern of the clothing more than color would have). Good image!</td>', 'Nice image, good lighting highlighting the skin tones, and I like the choice to go in black and white (which I think most likely emphasized the pattern of the clothing more than color would have). Good image!', '2007-01-02 10:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170006, 442342, 43073, '<td valign="top">The focus here is troubling for me; the entire thing seems out of focus, and while it''s a neat idea for a pattern, the bit of floor showing in the upper right corner seems out of place and the background green doesn''t work for me. Also, the subject matter isn''t well placed in the image field on the whole, I think.</td>', 'The focus here is troubling for me; the entire thing seems out of focus, and while it''s a neat idea for a pattern, the bit of floor showing in the upper right corner seems out of place and the background green doesn''t work for me. Also, the subject matter isn''t well placed in the image field on the whole, I think.', '2007-01-02 10:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170012, 442366, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice image, though the overexposed taxi lights don''t work for me and detract from the impact of the image as a whole. A bit brighter, with perhaps a bit more contrast would have worked for me, though I like the choice of black and white, and also the long horizontal proportions of the photo.</td>', 'Nice image, though the overexposed taxi lights don''t work for me and detract from the impact of the image as a whole. A bit brighter, with perhaps a bit more contrast would have worked for me, though I like the choice of black and white, and also the long horizontal proportions of the photo.', '2007-01-02 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170017, 442111, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the juxtaposition of the pattern against the rest of the image (which of course has other patterns in it, too, such as the walkway), but the lack of a clear focus on any one (or greater) spot on the pattern bothers me just a bit.</td>', 'I like this shot, the juxtaposition of the pattern against the rest of the image (which of course has other patterns in it, too, such as the walkway), but the lack of a clear focus on any one (or greater) spot on the pattern bothers me just a bit.', '2007-01-02 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170023, 441102, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good use of depth of field, and nice contrast between the lighter, out-of-focus foreground and the darker, inner, sharply focused tube. I think I might have cropped it so that the end of the tube itself was a bit more to the left or the right (probably left, as that''s the way it''s bending). But that''s just what I would have done!</td>', 'Nice image, good use of depth of field, and nice contrast between the lighter, out-of-focus foreground and the darker, inner, sharply focused tube. I think I might have cropped it so that the end of the tube itself was a bit more to the left or the right (probably left, as that''s the way it''s bending). But that''s just what I would have done!', '2007-01-02 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170035, 442133, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat image with a nice title, though keeping the background building in focus may have emphasized the pattern a bit more.</td>', 'Neat image with a nice title, though keeping the background building in focus may have emphasized the pattern a bit more.', '2007-01-02 10:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170037, 442647, 43073, '<td valign="top">It may be mandatory, but it''s a nice shot, well done, with good use of lighting and shading. I like the white sheet covering the whole lower right corner, it adds impact to the shot.</td>', 'It may be mandatory, but it''s a nice shot, well done, with good use of lighting and shading. I like the white sheet covering the whole lower right corner, it adds impact to the shot.', '2007-01-02 10:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170047, 442657, 58538, '<td valign="top">This grabbed my attention in thumbnail form. Great contrast ans what patience.</td>', 'This grabbed my attention in thumbnail form. Great contrast ans what patience.', '2007-01-02 10:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170054, 442978, 43073, '<td valign="top">The angle of this shot throws me a bit, and the contrast with the sky isn''t enough for me, though I like the brighter sky to the right-hand of the image, this is mostly lost given the grey that makes up the background sky to the rest of the image. Increased contrast would have improved this, I think, along with a bit of sharpening to heighten the contrast even more.</td>', 'The angle of this shot throws me a bit, and the contrast with the sky isn''t enough for me, though I like the brighter sky to the right-hand of the image, this is mostly lost given the grey that makes up the background sky to the rest of the image. Increased contrast would have improved this, I think, along with a bit of sharpening to heighten the contrast even more.', '2007-01-02 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170058, 442694, 58538, '<td valign="top">The leaf look a bit out of focus to me eyes</td>', 'The leaf look a bit out of focus to me eyes', '2007-01-02 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170061, 442142, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good use of depth of field to bring a large portion of the image into focus and emphasizing the depth of the pattern itself.</td>', 'Nice image, good use of depth of field to bring a large portion of the image into focus and emphasizing the depth of the pattern itself.', '2007-01-02 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170062, 442714, 58538, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the unecessary elements cropped out (sky, mountains, etc)</td>', 'I would have liked to see the unecessary elements cropped out (sky, mountains, etc)', '2007-01-02 10:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170065, 441250, 58538, '<td valign="top">brrrr</td>', 'brrrr', '2007-01-02 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170067, 442887, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, both technically and in terms of subject matter. Good use of focus (I''m not sure I could have avoided the temptation to use a more limited depth of field here, but I''m really glad you didn''t). The stark background makes it; anything distracting it the background would have really hurt the image, I think.</td>', 'Really nice image, both technically and in terms of subject matter. Good use of focus (I''m not sure I could have avoided the temptation to use a more limited depth of field here, but I''m really glad you didn''t). The stark background makes it; anything distracting it the background would have really hurt the image, I think.', '2007-01-02 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170071, 442879, 58538, '<td valign="top">a bit washed out?</td>', 'a bit washed out?', '2007-01-02 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170082, 442547, 58538, '<td valign="top">just doesn''t do it 4 me</td>', 'just doesn''t do it 4 me', '2007-01-02 10:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170085, 443027, 58538, '<td valign="top">makes me feel un-easy</td>', 'makes me feel un-easy', '2007-01-02 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170089, 442673, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern, well photographed, but I would have liked to have seen either an intentional "skewing" of the lines toward a diagonal, or a more precise shot that aligned the pattern in a perfectly straight way. The slight leftward shift as you move down the image is perceptable here, and doesn''t look to me to have been intended.</td>', 'Interesting pattern, well photographed, but I would have liked to have seen either an intentional "skewing" of the lines toward a diagonal, or a more precise shot that aligned the pattern in a perfectly straight way. The slight leftward shift as you move down the image is perceptable here, and doesn''t look to me to have been intended.', '2007-01-02 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170093, 442726, 58538, '<td valign="top">too contrasty for my taste. Whites blown out and few steps between them and blacks</td>', 'too contrasty for my taste. Whites blown out and few steps between them and blacks', '2007-01-02 10:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170094, 442821, 58538, '<td valign="top">good alignments</td>', 'good alignments', '2007-01-02 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170096, 441856, 58538, '<td valign="top">intersting</td>', 'intersting', '2007-01-02 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170100, 442647, 58538, '<td valign="top">mandatorily nice</td>', 'mandatorily nice', '2007-01-02 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170103, 441090, 43073, '<td valign="top">I noticed this image immediately on the thumbnails page. Very catchy, well done, good use of lighting, nice choice of model and props. I like it (can you tell?). I might have (just might have, I''d have to see it done) liked a bit more depth of field on the light, to bring some of it into clear focus where it meets the model''s face. Also, the extra white dot in the sunglasses is distracting. I know I''m being picky, but with shots like this one, that''s all that''s left to do.</td>', 'I noticed this image immediately on the thumbnails page. Very catchy, well done, good use of lighting, nice choice of model and props. I like it (can you tell?). I might have (just might have, I''d have to see it done) liked a bit more depth of field on the light, to bring some of it into clear focus where it meets the model''s face. Also, the extra white dot in the sunglasses is distracting. I know I''m being picky, but with shots like this one, that''s all that''s left to do.', '2007-01-02 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170105, 442775, 58538, '<td valign="top">pretty busy, would have liked t osee a single pattern more isolated</td>', 'pretty busy, would have liked t osee a single pattern more isolated', '2007-01-02 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170107, 441949, 58538, '<td valign="top">intersting</td>', 'intersting', '2007-01-02 10:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170110, 443026, 58538, '<td valign="top">yes indeed</td>', 'yes indeed', '2007-01-02 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170112, 443018, 58538, '<td valign="top">interesting idea</td>', 'interesting idea', '2007-01-02 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170129, 442300, 58538, '<td valign="top">This would have been neater with a closer shot and more detail I think</td>', 'This would have been neater with a closer shot and more detail I think', '2007-01-02 11:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170133, 440967, 58538, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2007-01-02 11:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170141, 442674, 58538, '<td valign="top">"Patterns" don''t really come to mind for me, nice shot though</td>', '"Patterns" don''t really come to mind for me, nice shot though', '2007-01-02 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170145, 442340, 58538, '<td valign="top">the apple doesn''t seem tack sharp to me</td>', 'the apple doesn''t seem tack sharp to me', '2007-01-02 11:05:26.000000', NULL, 1);
