(3170221, 441537, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good pattern and one of the better uses of color I''ve seen in this challenge (though honestly I''m not that far into it yet). As for composition, I think I would have liked to have seen the model''s eyes; the hat being down over them seems a bit forced. Otherwise I like the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, good pattern and one of the better uses of color I''ve seen in this challenge (though honestly I''m not that far into it yet). As for composition, I think I would have liked to have seen the model''s eyes; the hat being down over them seems a bit forced. Otherwise I like the shot.', '2007-01-02 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170222, 442877, 58538, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2007-01-02 11:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170224, 442948, 58538, '<td valign="top">oof wing tips</td>', 'oof wing tips', '2007-01-02 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170227, 442855, 58538, '<td valign="top">didn''t grab my eye</td>', 'didn''t grab my eye', '2007-01-02 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170229, 442737, 58538, '<td valign="top">funny color cast</td>', 'funny color cast', '2007-01-02 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170233, 442941, 58538, '<td valign="top">may have been more intersting with greater DOF</td>', 'may have been more intersting with greater DOF', '2007-01-02 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170234, 442678, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot, I like the incorporation of the person here (I might have waited until they were gone, but it would have looked very different, and I think I like this better). The person also helps with the really bright/over-exposed light coming in from the end, though the darkness of the person almost empasizes that overexposure. I don''t have a clue what I would done to the photo to ''fix'' that, though, but it does bother me some.</td>', 'Really neat shot, I like the incorporation of the person here (I might have waited until they were gone, but it would have looked very different, and I think I like this better). The person also helps with the really bright/over-exposed light coming in from the end, though the darkness of the person almost empasizes that overexposure. I don''t have a clue what I would done to the photo to ''fix'' that, though, but it does bother me some.', '2007-01-02 11:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170235, 442016, 58538, '<td valign="top">intersting, You grabbed my attention.</td>', 'intersting, You grabbed my attention.', '2007-01-02 11:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170238, 442238, 58538, '<td valign="top">intersting</td>', 'intersting', '2007-01-02 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170240, 442479, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really neat photo, excellent use of light and contrast, and focusing depth of field on the center spring (is it a slinky?) works really well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Really neat photo, excellent use of light and contrast, and focusing depth of field on the center spring (is it a slinky?) works really well. Nicely done.', '2007-01-02 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170241, 443006, 58538, '<td valign="top">didn''t do it for me</td>', 'didn''t do it for me', '2007-01-02 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170246, 442880, 58538, '<td valign="top">perhaps a tighte crop would have been more intersting</td>', 'perhaps a tighte crop would have been more intersting', '2007-01-02 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170249, 441861, 58538, '<td valign="top">didn''t grab my eye</td>', 'didn''t grab my eye', '2007-01-02 11:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170251, 441949, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, the adjacent buildings fit together nicely. The coloring in the photo, though, seems a bit off to me, whether it''s over-saturated or something similar, I''m not sure. It looks very processed to me (there is a hint of yellow, for example, on the lower horizontal stripe on the left building, and I don''t think it''s belongs there). A pretty nice shot, though, on the whole.</td>', 'I like the composition here, the adjacent buildings fit together nicely. The coloring in the photo, though, seems a bit off to me, whether it''s over-saturated or something similar, I''m not sure. It looks very processed to me (there is a hint of yellow, for example, on the lower horizontal stripe on the left building, and I don''t think it''s belongs there). A pretty nice shot, though, on the whole.', '2007-01-02 11:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
