(3170648, 442878, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well executed and well presented. I can only make picky comments, like that the second ball from the left on the bottom has a red mark that bugs me, and the double sparkle does a bit, too (really picky, I know!!). A really nice image, well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, well executed and well presented. I can only make picky comments, like that the second ball from the left on the bottom has a red mark that bugs me, and the double sparkle does a bit, too (really picky, I know!!). A really nice image, well done.', '2007-01-02 12:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
