(3170822, 442462, 46996, '<td valign="top">What an original idea!! Like it !!</td>', 'What an original idea!! Like it !!', '2007-01-02 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170826, 442383, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice close up, with added effect from the extremely limited depth of field. I actually would have liked either a bit more depth because of the next decoration (which seems strangely out of focus given its proximity). This might have come off better to me (and this is all personal preference, not "objective" critique) if it had been cropped a bit more on the left; the extremely out of focus bits on the left are distracting for me. Still, nice shot overall.</td>', 'Nice close up, with added effect from the extremely limited depth of field. I actually would have liked either a bit more depth because of the next decoration (which seems strangely out of focus given its proximity). This might have come off better to me (and this is all personal preference, not "objective" critique) if it had been cropped a bit more on the left; the extremely out of focus bits on the left are distracting for me. Still, nice shot overall.', '2007-01-02 13:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170831, 442403, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!!!</td>', 'Very cool shot!!!', '2007-01-02 13:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170835, 441841, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good photo with nice composition, but not focused enough on the pattern for my tastes; more of a portrait with a pattern on a bag. Nice use of narrow depth of field to focus the portrait, though.</td>', 'Good photo with nice composition, but not focused enough on the pattern for my tastes; more of a portrait with a pattern on a bag. Nice use of narrow depth of field to focus the portrait, though.', '2007-01-02 13:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170841, 442499, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern you discovered here, but shouldn''t it be 3x3x3x3 (3 birds by 3 birds by 3 birds by 3 wires)? I generally like the photo, though I would have liked a bit more cropping at the stop (even if it made it a bit shorter in height), to put the line of birds nearer the rule of thirds line (notice I said nearer, not necessarily "on"). Still, nice shot, well executed.</td>', 'Nice pattern you discovered here, but shouldn''t it be 3x3x3x3 (3 birds by 3 birds by 3 birds by 3 wires)? I generally like the photo, though I would have liked a bit more cropping at the stop (even if it made it a bit shorter in height), to put the line of birds nearer the rule of thirds line (notice I said nearer, not necessarily "on"). Still, nice shot, well executed.', '2007-01-02 13:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170846, 442851, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot, good detail, nice depth of field, well composed, and looks pretty fluid to me (the eye moves naturally across it).</td>', 'Very nice macro shot, good detail, nice depth of field, well composed, and looks pretty fluid to me (the eye moves naturally across it).', '2007-01-02 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170854, 442876, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter here, but have trouble figuring out where I''m supposed to focus; some of this is depth of field that might have been broader, allowing for more of the shot to be in focus (as my eye wanders to the bottom and it goes out of focus, it loses something for me). Generally nice shot, though.</td>', 'I like the subject matter here, but have trouble figuring out where I''m supposed to focus; some of this is depth of field that might have been broader, allowing for more of the shot to be in focus (as my eye wanders to the bottom and it goes out of focus, it loses something for me). Generally nice shot, though.', '2007-01-02 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170857, 442879, 43073, '<td valign="top">A generally nice macro shot, though it looks a bit over-exposed on the right (this probably supposed to be reflection of a light sorce, but it''s too much for my eye). Composition is pretty good on this shot.</td>', 'A generally nice macro shot, though it looks a bit over-exposed on the right (this probably supposed to be reflection of a light sorce, but it''s too much for my eye). Composition is pretty good on this shot.', '2007-01-02 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170863, 442645, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, with interesting use of shadow (I doubt I could have pulled this shot off). Nice image.</td>', 'Interesting shot, with interesting use of shadow (I doubt I could have pulled this shot off). Nice image.', '2007-01-02 13:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170869, 441889, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting selective focus, and interesting pattern, but the bright area is a bit too bright for my tastes, and the loss of focus to both back and front is also a bit extreme for me. Nice shot on the whole, though.</td>', 'Interesting selective focus, and interesting pattern, but the bright area is a bit too bright for my tastes, and the loss of focus to both back and front is also a bit extreme for me. Nice shot on the whole, though.', '2007-01-02 13:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170880, 443027, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter (good choice), but I would have preferred it cropped a bit more to not show the bottom right corner. The wide depth of field works well, though, and I really like the buildings outside that you almost don''t see at first. Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter (good choice), but I would have preferred it cropped a bit more to not show the bottom right corner. The wide depth of field works well, though, and I really like the buildings outside that you almost don''t see at first. Nicely done.', '2007-01-02 13:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170889, 442996, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot, well executed (not a shot I could have pulled off, I''m guessing). Excellent contrast between the lower, greyer part and the upper bluer part. Good use of color. Would have rated it higher had the pattern been more apparent (with this use of "pattern" any photo has it, as patterns are everywhere; I like to see a bit more focus on the actual pattern rather than asking the viewer to accept that a pattern is there just because). Well done.</td>', 'Really neat shot, well executed (not a shot I could have pulled off, I''m guessing). Excellent contrast between the lower, greyer part and the upper bluer part. Good use of color. Would have rated it higher had the pattern been more apparent (with this use of "pattern" any photo has it, as patterns are everywhere; I like to see a bit more focus on the actual pattern rather than asking the viewer to accept that a pattern is there just because). Well done.', '2007-01-02 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170899, 441250, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat photo on the whole (nice "found" pattern). I would have liked to have seen a bit more attention to composition either in the shot or in the processing (a bit more cropping of the top, which seems to detract from the shot for my eye), and a bit more brightness to the color differences (especially as there are only three main colors in the image).</td>', 'Neat photo on the whole (nice "found" pattern). I would have liked to have seen a bit more attention to composition either in the shot or in the processing (a bit more cropping of the top, which seems to detract from the shot for my eye), and a bit more brightness to the color differences (especially as there are only three main colors in the image).', '2007-01-02 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170913, 442988, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat shot to look at; I honestly have no idea what it is, but it''s a nice artistic photo. I like the use of two primary colors (plus shades of these) in the gold and the black. Really neat shot.</td>', 'This is a really neat shot to look at; I honestly have no idea what it is, but it''s a nice artistic photo. I like the use of two primary colors (plus shades of these) in the gold and the black. Really neat shot.', '2007-01-02 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170922, 442911, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good pattern, well executed, but I would have worked a bit more on the model to move the extra hairs that cross the head at the top of the photo (these could probably have been cropped out without much loss of effect). I probably would have cropped out the loss of focus in the lower left corner, as well, but that''s me!</td>', 'Good pattern, well executed, but I would have worked a bit more on the model to move the extra hairs that cross the head at the top of the photo (these could probably have been cropped out without much loss of effect). I probably would have cropped out the loss of focus in the lower left corner, as well, but that''s me!', '2007-01-02 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170930, 442569, 48263, '<td valign="top">if the dof was not so short this would be one of the best</td>', 'if the dof was not so short this would be one of the best', '2007-01-02 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
