(3170980, 442682, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to find what it is that I don''t like about this shot, which has an interesting pattern and technically suitably executed shot. I think perhaps the pattern is too all-encompassing for me, and it''s too simple of a pattern to carry the weight of the entire subject matter of the photo. The picture is <i>too much</i> pattern, without any context. While I can tell what it is (at least I think I can), something broader would have appealed to me more.</td>', 'I''m struggling to find what it is that I don''t like about this shot, which has an interesting pattern and technically suitably executed shot. I think perhaps the pattern is too all-encompassing for me, and it''s too simple of a pattern to carry the weight of the entire subject matter of the photo. The picture is too much pattern, without any context. While I can tell what it is (at least I think I can), something broader would have appealed to me more.', '2007-01-02 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170990, 442694, 64733, '<td valign="top">i think the real story here is the natural pattern from the fruit vs. the man-made pattern on the paper towel.  i really like this.  did you have to treat the strawberry with anything to give it that finish?</td>', 'i think the real story here is the natural pattern from the fruit vs. the man-made pattern on the paper towel.  i really like this.  did you have to treat the strawberry with anything to give it that finish?', '2007-01-02 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
