(3171777, 442821, 16197, '<td valign="top">fun concept.  But I feel cut off here.  Also, I think it would have been better if you had some towels sideways and others stacked, as in playing a game.  Otherwise they would all need to face the same direction.  Here it looks kinda messy.</td>', 'fun concept.  But I feel cut off here.  Also, I think it would have been better if you had some towels sideways and others stacked, as in playing a game.  Otherwise they would all need to face the same direction.  Here it looks kinda messy.', '2007-01-02 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171785, 441581, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Personaly I would have liked to see a tighter crop to not show anything outside the fountain.  Also, it appears to have a neat image feel and usm that just doesn''t work for me.  But it is a very creative Idea.  Also the shadow of the side wall into the fountain distracts.  Think of what this would look like at a differnt time of day with the shadows of the water and no others...</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Personaly I would have liked to see a tighter crop to not show anything outside the fountain.  Also, it appears to have a neat image feel and usm that just doesn''t work for me.  But it is a very creative Idea.  Also the shadow of the side wall into the fountain distracts.  Think of what this would look like at a differnt time of day with the shadows of the water and no others...', '2007-01-02 17:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171787, 442882, 16197, '<td valign="top">If There were two more smaller windows I would buy it.   The image is a nice image overall.  Just a few distracting elements like the bottom right corner.  I would also liked to see a bit more contrast to it maybe.</td>', 'If There were two more smaller windows I would buy it.   The image is a nice image overall.  Just a few distracting elements like the bottom right corner.  I would also liked to see a bit more contrast to it maybe.', '2007-01-02 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
