(3172671, 442624, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure &amp; lighting - modeling came out nice here.  It''s a hair crooked, but you can''t tell unless you actually check.  This is a nice study!  Personally, I considered doing toilet paper so I''m glad someone else was like-minded :&gt;</td>', 'Nice exposure & lighting - modeling came out nice here.  It''s a hair crooked, but you can''t tell unless you actually check.  This is a nice study!  Personally, I considered doing toilet paper so I''m glad someone else was like-minded :>', '2007-01-02 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3172672, 441321, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very busy - you eyes go everywhere on this one.  I think cropping it more would have been better - get rid of the bloom on the right, the off vertical line on the left &amp; give visual less weight to the top &amp; bottom portions.  I do think it is nice, though!</td>', 'Very busy - you eyes go everywhere on this one.  I think cropping it more would have been better - get rid of the bloom on the right, the off vertical line on the left & give visual less weight to the top & bottom portions.  I do think it is nice, though!', '2007-01-02 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
