(3173259, 442979, 57570, '<td valign="top">wow!!!! my first ribbon!!!  what a lovely treat for the new year. <br/>Thanks everyone for your ratings and comments. <br/> <br/>Not sure if this post will land up in the photographer''s comments section. some had asked during voting as to how i shot this.....<br/>the setup is simple...straws are in a glass lit from above. the image is actually shot at three focal lengths. I set the camera on long exposure, lit the shot at 18mm then at 35mm and then at 55mm.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-03 00:51:03.</i></td>', 'wow!!!! my first ribbon!!!  what a lovely treat for the new year. Thanks everyone for your ratings and comments.  Not sure if this post will land up in the photographer''s comments section. some had asked during voting as to how i shot this.....the setup is simple...straws are in a glass lit from above. the image is actually shot at three focal lengths. I set the camera on long exposure, lit the shot at 18mm then at 35mm and then at 55mm.', '2007-01-03 00:50:29.000000', '2007-01-03 00:51:03.000000', 0),
