(3174445, 442238, 23484, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think you got a raw deal on this shot.  This is far better than a 4.8. I like the black and white and I like the dark feel to it.  I''ve always like those "dark" shots.  I gave this a 6 and the only reason I didn''t give it a 7 was because of the soft focus.</td>', 'Personally, I think you got a raw deal on this shot.  This is far better than a 4.8. I like the black and white and I like the dark feel to it.  I''ve always like those "dark" shots.  I gave this a 6 and the only reason I didn''t give it a 7 was because of the soft focus.', '2007-01-03 08:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
