(3174525, 442844, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on this a lot, and the colors are rich and pattern lovely. I think a tighter crop might have bumped you even higher, as the detailed rock takes focus off snake.</td>', 'I like the perspective on this a lot, and the colors are rich and pattern lovely. I think a tighter crop might have bumped you even higher, as the detailed rock takes focus off snake.', '2007-01-03 08:58:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3174551, 442481, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob,<br/>Great shot and look at that strong finish! Congrats! I think you chose an interesting perspective on this shot and the patterns over each window combined with the overall pattern are very strong. Nice rich colors, too. Great job!</td>', 'Bob,Great shot and look at that strong finish! Congrats! I think you chose an interesting perspective on this shot and the patterns over each window combined with the overall pattern are very strong. Nice rich colors, too. Great job!', '2007-01-03 09:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3174573, 442339, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeff,<br/>This is a beautiful, evocative photo. I really love the colors in the candles, and think you did a very good job with composition (can be pretty difficult with this type of photo, I think). I have no idea how to do it myself, but IMO this would be even stronger with more color showing in the flames - they look a bit blown. <br/>That aside, I think you''ve got a winner here in a different challenge. I also think this would sell well among both Jewish and non-Jewish audience.<br/>BTW - I enjoyed reading about Chanukah, above. Thanks for sharing your traditions!</td>', 'Jeff,This is a beautiful, evocative photo. I really love the colors in the candles, and think you did a very good job with composition (can be pretty difficult with this type of photo, I think). I have no idea how to do it myself, but IMO this would be even stronger with more color showing in the flames - they look a bit blown. That aside, I think you''ve got a winner here in a different challenge. I also think this would sell well among both Jewish and non-Jewish audience.BTW - I enjoyed reading about Chanukah, above. Thanks for sharing your traditions!', '2007-01-03 09:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
