(3174846, 442844, 65035, '<td valign="top">He looks so comfortable, The colors in the snake a beautiful and nice focus. I agree with the comments on cropping I''d like to see it with the left side and bottom cropped to bring more attention to the snakes head. I  didn''t vote on this challenge but I''m scared of snakes so I tend to vote them a little higher for bravery.</td>', 'He looks so comfortable, The colors in the snake a beautiful and nice focus. I agree with the comments on cropping I''d like to see it with the left side and bottom cropped to bring more attention to the snakes head. I  didn''t vote on this challenge but I''m scared of snakes so I tend to vote them a little higher for bravery.', '2007-01-03 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
