(3176480, 441920, 52130, '<td valign="top">pattern-wise I think you met the challenge very well, evern though it might be a little busy. I love the colors, they have a very summery feel to them. The only thing I would wish could have been have changed was the sky being blown out, but editing was basic so you really couldn''t have done much about that.</td>', 'pattern-wise I think you met the challenge very well, evern though it might be a little busy. I love the colors, they have a very summery feel to them. The only thing I would wish could have been have changed was the sky being blown out, but editing was basic so you really couldn''t have done much about that.', '2007-01-03 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176491, 442481, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like the almost grungy look to this. I think the focus is a little soft and the lighting could''ve been more dynamic, but I like it itherwise :)</td>', 'I like the almost grungy look to this. I think the focus is a little soft and the lighting could''ve been more dynamic, but I like it itherwise :)', '2007-01-03 15:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176493, 442852, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo. Really great, best pose you could have hoped for in my opinion.</td>', 'Brilliant photo. Really great, best pose you could have hoped for in my opinion.', '2007-01-03 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176497, 443003, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like her pose, but the straight-on flash isn''t very appealing, especially since the blanket she''s on is somewhat reflective. I wish the crop was a little more diagonal or in a way where you could see her whole body.</td>', 'I like her pose, but the straight-on flash isn''t very appealing, especially since the blanket she''s on is somewhat reflective. I wish the crop was a little more diagonal or in a way where you could see her whole body.', '2007-01-03 15:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176506, 442300, 52130, '<td valign="top">I think a slightly tighter crop, a conversion to black and white, and more contrast would have made this so much better. I did a photo similar to this by using those editing steps:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=435937" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Try editing it like that and I''m sure it will look awesome :)</td>', 'I think a slightly tighter crop, a conversion to black and white, and more contrast would have made this so much better. I did a photo similar to this by using those editing steps:   Try editing it like that and I''m sure it will look awesome :)', '2007-01-03 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176516, 442839, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great textures and I liked your title. Go F/stoppers!</td>', 'Great textures and I liked your title. Go F/stoppers!', '2007-01-03 15:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176523, 442983, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very dizzying Robert. Congrats on a nice finish! Re: your story, wouldn''t anyone with malice on their mind develop a nice cover? Such as a company jacket. But i''m glad someone''s looking out for your safety. :)</td>', 'Very dizzying Robert. Congrats on a nice finish! Re: your story, wouldn''t anyone with malice on their mind develop a nice cover? Such as a company jacket. But i''m glad someone''s looking out for your safety. :)', '2007-01-03 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176524, 442339, 52130, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''m suprised this didn''t score higher. It''s not a perfect pattern, but the flames are not over-exposed, the color tone is just right, it''s a good composition, and the lighting on the candles is very appealing. I love your educating description, since a lot of people aren''t sure what Chanukah is about, so it''s nice that you can explain it.</td>', 'Personally, I''m suprised this didn''t score higher. It''s not a perfect pattern, but the flames are not over-exposed, the color tone is just right, it''s a good composition, and the lighting on the candles is very appealing. I love your educating description, since a lot of people aren''t sure what Chanukah is about, so it''s nice that you can explain it.', '2007-01-03 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176530, 442516, 42013, '<td valign="top">It looks like a fan to me. 6+ is good!</td>', 'It looks like a fan to me. 6+ is good!', '2007-01-03 15:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176538, 442396, 52130, '<td valign="top">I think inverting the image just made the color sceme a little too unusual. I like the idea of circles and triangles, but I think the composition could have been better placed.</td>', 'I think inverting the image just made the color sceme a little too unusual. I like the idea of circles and triangles, but I think the composition could have been better placed.', '2007-01-03 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176540, 442581, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great catch here. I''ll definitely look at manholes more in a different light now!</td>', 'Great catch here. I''ll definitely look at manholes more in a different light now!', '2007-01-03 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176550, 442581, 52130, '<td valign="top">I agree with you, I love the details in these covers. This one looks particularly nice because the ground is stone instead of pavement. Th detail in this is very nice as well as the colors of the metal, rust, and stones.</td>', 'I agree with you, I love the details in these covers. This one looks particularly nice because the ground is stone instead of pavement. Th detail in this is very nice as well as the colors of the metal, rust, and stones.', '2007-01-03 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176678, 441785, 36988, '<td valign="top">You really nailed it this time Roz. Very well done!</td>', 'You really nailed it this time Roz. Very well done!', '2007-01-03 16:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176868, 442927, 66597, '<td valign="top">Leah,<br/>Congrats, congrats, congrats on your high finish. Very much deserved for this interesting persepctive and wonderful vanishing point.<br/>Not sure you suck enough for Team Suck, but glad you''re with us all the same :-)</td>', 'Leah,Congrats, congrats, congrats on your high finish. Very much deserved for this interesting persepctive and wonderful vanishing point.Not sure you suck enough for Team Suck, but glad you''re with us all the same :-)', '2007-01-03 16:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176873, 441710, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats on #1. Great tones and contrast. Would look excellent as a BW as well.</td>', 'Congrats on #1. Great tones and contrast. Would look excellent as a BW as well.', '2007-01-03 16:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176980, 442979, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great picture and very ingenious to use multiple exposures to fulfill your vision. Congrats!</td>', 'Great picture and very ingenious to use multiple exposures to fulfill your vision. Congrats!', '2007-01-03 16:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176998, 441920, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne,<br/>Is it just me, or is the pattern in that gate eerily similar to the pattern in the window I entered? Your photo is without doubt a lot stronger, though, and I''m surprised it didn''t garner at least a 5.5. I''m trying to figure out why the relatively low score, and can only think it is due to voters looking for more repetition in pattern (and a slightly blown sky). I really like this, think it has good composition, and I <i>like</i> the business. Just goes to show you can''t please ''em all, right? 7 from me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-03 16:54:19.</i></td>', 'Julianne,Is it just me, or is the pattern in that gate eerily similar to the pattern in the window I entered? Your photo is without doubt a lot stronger, though, and I''m surprised it didn''t garner at least a 5.5. I''m trying to figure out why the relatively low score, and can only think it is due to voters looking for more repetition in pattern (and a slightly blown sky). I really like this, think it has good composition, and I like the business. Just goes to show you can''t please ''em all, right? 7 from me.', '2007-01-03 16:53:50.000000', '2007-01-03 16:54:19.000000', 0),
(3177083, 440767, 67841, '<td valign="top">''rook you are on your way to fast becoming a cult favorite here at dpc!<br/> <br/>I love the fact that they dq''d the photo because you took it before the challenge started &amp; because the evidence for such was plastered across the bottom right of your submission!  They could have used the very fact that you have the date there as a reason but I''m so glad they pursued the path of irony...<br/> <br/>Keep it up, mate -  I''ll be watching for your shots each challenge!</td>', '''rook you are on your way to fast becoming a cult favorite here at dpc! I love the fact that they dq''d the photo because you took it before the challenge started & because the evidence for such was plastered across the bottom right of your submission!  They could have used the very fact that you have the date there as a reason but I''m so glad they pursued the path of irony... Keep it up, mate -  I''ll be watching for your shots each challenge!', '2007-01-03 17:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177093, 442690, 67875, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW. Must be beginners luck...Thanks for all your comments and votes!</td>', 'All I can say is WOW. Must be beginners luck...Thanks for all your comments and votes!', '2007-01-03 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177421, 442339, 70, '<td valign="top">I agree...it''s in focus, has a variety of colors and seems well-exposed. The issue, I would guess (I didn''t vote in this challenge) is that PATTERN didn''t smack me in the face like most of the shots in the top 20 did (I didn''t look past that). I can see how it could be considered pattern and I don''t think that it doesn''t meet the challenge...it''s just missing that WHOA THERE''S A PATTERN! bit.  Cool shot, though.</td>', 'I agree...it''s in focus, has a variety of colors and seems well-exposed. The issue, I would guess (I didn''t vote in this challenge) is that PATTERN didn''t smack me in the face like most of the shots in the top 20 did (I didn''t look past that). I can see how it could be considered pattern and I don''t think that it doesn''t meet the challenge...it''s just missing that WHOA THERE''S A PATTERN! bit.  Cool shot, though.', '2007-01-03 18:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177453, 442339, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s just not much of a pattern...  Or an interesting shot even.  You say it''s Chanukah candles...  Why didn''t you include the holder?  That probably would have helped...<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess it''s just not much of a pattern...  Or an interesting shot even.  You say it''s Chanukah candles...  Why didn''t you include the holder?  That probably would have helped...TC', '2007-01-03 18:23:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177480, 441710, 15305, '<td valign="top">Don''t be in shock!! You deserve the blue!</td>', 'Don''t be in shock!! You deserve the blue!', '2007-01-03 18:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177482, 442257, 52130, '<td valign="top">I can''t find much wrong with this. The curving aspect is nice, but It''s a shame about the lighting. Maybe the brighness and contrast could have been manipulated in another way.</td>', 'I can''t find much wrong with this. The curving aspect is nice, but It''s a shame about the lighting. Maybe the brighness and contrast could have been manipulated in another way.', '2007-01-03 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177488, 442844, 52130, '<td valign="top">I love the "pose" of the snake. Maybe you could''ve taken it from a straight-on perspective so you could have seen both of it''s eyes. The detail is very nice.</td>', 'I love the "pose" of the snake. Maybe you could''ve taken it from a straight-on perspective so you could have seen both of it''s eyes. The detail is very nice.', '2007-01-03 18:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177506, 441581, 52130, '<td valign="top">I love the pattern in this, but maybe you could have cropped out all of the sky and that angle on the left, which are somewhat distracting. Then the shadows of the water would stand out more, giving more emphasis on "pattern". Also the focus seems just a tad soft.</td>', 'I love the pattern in this, but maybe you could have cropped out all of the sky and that angle on the left, which are somewhat distracting. Then the shadows of the water would stand out more, giving more emphasis on "pattern". Also the focus seems just a tad soft.', '2007-01-03 18:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177528, 442742, 52130, '<td valign="top">hehe, you crazy gal! You look a little uncomfortable, but it must have been hard to shoot. The only things that bpther me abot this is that the stckings are too dark; I think bare legs might have worked better. Also, your legs look a bit akward and short. I think if you had taken this from a lower perspective, it would have made you look taller.</td>', 'hehe, you crazy gal! You look a little uncomfortable, but it must have been hard to shoot. The only things that bpther me abot this is that the stckings are too dark; I think bare legs might have worked better. Also, your legs look a bit akward and short. I think if you had taken this from a lower perspective, it would have made you look taller.', '2007-01-03 18:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177549, 442934, 52130, '<td valign="top">I think this might have done better if the lines were made in marker instead of paint. It would look sharper and cleaner and probably be a lot easier to do. There also seems to be a shadow on the thumb, which distracted me. The contrast is a little too high because the hand and cheek are blown out. That being said it''s a good pattern and a nice pose!</td>', 'I think this might have done better if the lines were made in marker instead of paint. It would look sharper and cleaner and probably be a lot easier to do. There also seems to be a shadow on the thumb, which distracted me. The contrast is a little too high because the hand and cheek are blown out. That being said it''s a good pattern and a nice pose!', '2007-01-03 18:41:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177565, 442478, 52130, '<td valign="top">well, it''s definitely a pattern, but I think if you had added something simple, like a ball or an apple into the LL or UR corner, it would have made it more interesting.</td>', 'well, it''s definitely a pattern, but I think if you had added something simple, like a ball or an apple into the LL or UR corner, it would have made it more interesting.', '2007-01-03 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177602, 442979, 70867, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I love this. And congratulations.</td>', 'Fantastic!  I love this. And congratulations.', '2007-01-03 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177705, 441785, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, missed this one before.  It''s good.  Wonderful pattern.  Love the blue gradient.</td>', 'Wow, missed this one before.  It''s good.  Wonderful pattern.  Love the blue gradient.', '2007-01-03 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177725, 441810, 5112, '<td valign="top">What a find!  THis is beautiful.  Congratulations on your high placement, it is well deserved.</td>', 'What a find!  THis is beautiful.  Congratulations on your high placement, it is well deserved.', '2007-01-03 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177727, 442339, 64446, '<td valign="top">It is amazing you were able to get a such sharp focus and lots of details of the candles. (I think it is a very difficult shot to do).<br/>Other than that, there is not much grabbing the viewer attention. I, particularly, would like so see vibrant colours, but they are rather faded. Also, the image is a lot dark, in spite of the 9 lit candles - so it doesn''t evoke much of a happy Festival of Lights, but a somber sad holiday. But maybe the biggest issue is that the image is "bi-dimensional": there is no depth on it: for example, it is hard to figure out which candle is the Shamesh (it seems to be the middle one, if one would know what to look for, which is not the case of most voters here at all) - I think I got this same problem with my entry, but mine the focus was not as good as yours...</td>', 'It is amazing you were able to get a such sharp focus and lots of details of the candles. (I think it is a very difficult shot to do).Other than that, there is not much grabbing the viewer attention. I, particularly, would like so see vibrant colours, but they are rather faded. Also, the image is a lot dark, in spite of the 9 lit candles - so it doesn''t evoke much of a happy Festival of Lights, but a somber sad holiday. But maybe the biggest issue is that the image is "bi-dimensional": there is no depth on it: for example, it is hard to figure out which candle is the Shamesh (it seems to be the middle one, if one would know what to look for, which is not the case of most voters here at all) - I think I got this same problem with my entry, but mine the focus was not as good as yours...', '2007-01-03 19:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177758, 442657, 53690, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job here!  I love the picture, and what a great score and placement!!</td>', 'Fantastic job here!  I love the picture, and what a great score and placement!!', '2007-01-03 19:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3177782, 442550, 19708, '<td valign="top">There are just some things in life that need not be thrust in our faces and frankly feel the shock value in doing this has no place on a site that is doing a photo-competition. This is best suited for certain websites that tailor to strong political and ethical statements.<br/>This is no different than taking a picture of a nasty booger plucked from someone''s nose - we''ve all seen them, just no need to show the world...</td>', 'There are just some things in life that need not be thrust in our faces and frankly feel the shock value in doing this has no place on a site that is doing a photo-competition. This is best suited for certain websites that tailor to strong political and ethical statements.This is no different than taking a picture of a nasty booger plucked from someone''s nose - we''ve all seen them, just no need to show the world...', '2007-01-03 19:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3178010, 442366, 48471, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop and a higher point of view would result in better patterns, but then I´d lose that nice natural feel that the two taxis and people at the top give to the image. I mean, it´s the top of the photo which brakes the purely geometrical, thus cold, patterny look of the image.<br/>Black and white works much better, because color is to distracting. And, as Jutilda observed, I wanted this to look like a shot from an old movie, with very strong contrast.<br/>Thanks...</td>', 'I think a tighter crop and a higher point of view would result in better patterns, but then I´d lose that nice natural feel that the two taxis and people at the top give to the image. I mean, it´s the top of the photo which brakes the purely geometrical, thus cold, patterny look of the image.Black and white works much better, because color is to distracting. And, as Jutilda observed, I wanted this to look like a shot from an old movie, with very strong contrast.Thanks...', '2007-01-03 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3178168, 442550, 37961, '<td valign="top">I don''t have any ethical objection to the display of this photo. However it really isn''t pattern related, and the baby looks pretty fresh. You have to wonder if this was an abortion or a full term baby that died of natural causes, or was ''snuffed'' out because of his or her infirmaties. Looks like he is missing arms and legs although many people survive this and are happy to be alive.<br/> <br/>You got alot of 1s because of the subject matter no doubt, but I think it''s unfair really...I am glad to have seen this baby. Atleast someone got to see him, and acknowledge his brief existence.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-04 23:32:18.</i></td>', 'I don''t have any ethical objection to the display of this photo. However it really isn''t pattern related, and the baby looks pretty fresh. You have to wonder if this was an abortion or a full term baby that died of natural causes, or was ''snuffed'' out because of his or her infirmaties. Looks like he is missing arms and legs although many people survive this and are happy to be alive. You got alot of 1s because of the subject matter no doubt, but I think it''s unfair really...I am glad to have seen this baby. Atleast someone got to see him, and acknowledge his brief existence.', '2007-01-03 21:20:05.000000', '2007-01-04 23:32:18.000000', 0),
(3178678, 442877, 67841, '<td valign="top">With this site, if you are only concerned about getting high scores &amp; ribbons, than you might be in for a rough ride.  <br/> <br/>If you are here to learn a lot about photography, to learn what kind of tastes YOU have, to learn the difference between what is ART &amp; what is POPULAR and how to find common ground between these two -- then I think you will have a great journey!<br/> <br/></td>', 'With this site, if you are only concerned about getting high scores & ribbons, than you might be in for a rough ride.   If you are here to learn a lot about photography, to learn what kind of tastes YOU have, to learn the difference between what is ART & what is POPULAR and how to find common ground between these two -- then I think you will have a great journey! ', '2007-01-03 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3178684, 442927, 44490, '<td valign="top">Fascinating pattern, good composition, lovely color shades.  Congratulations on your 5th place Honorable Mention!</td>', 'Fascinating pattern, good composition, lovely color shades.  Congratulations on your 5th place Honorable Mention!', '2007-01-03 23:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3178818, 442238, 66384, '<td valign="top">Catherine,<br/>You''re right; our patterns are very similar. It''s eerie that the two shots are side by side in the Team Suck thread. I also noticed that we were both using a pattern on top of another pattern to create additional patterns. Needless to say, I like your shot. And I like the black and white treatment. Sorry I can''t think of anything to improve it.</td>', 'Catherine,You''re right; our patterns are very similar. It''s eerie that the two shots are side by side in the Team Suck thread. I also noticed that we were both using a pattern on top of another pattern to create additional patterns. Needless to say, I like your shot. And I like the black and white treatment. Sorry I can''t think of anything to improve it.', '2007-01-04 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3178903, 442506, 48263, '<td valign="top">for everyone who thought these were drills you are wrong.  they are specially coated endmills.</td>', 'for everyone who thought these were drills you are wrong.  they are specially coated endmills.', '2007-01-04 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 0);
