(3179726, 442690, 68827, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 2nd place.<br/> <br/>Why would anyone vote a 1!<br/>This is a awesome photo.<br/> <br/>You should have gotten nothing under a 6 for sure and I would have given it a 9 or 10 if I had voted.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on 2nd place. Why would anyone vote a 1!This is a awesome photo. You should have gotten nothing under a 6 for sure and I would have given it a 9 or 10 if I had voted. ', '2007-01-04 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
