(3181423, 442530, 66952, '<td valign="top">I know that you know what you''re doing, so I won''t try to second guess....but I gave it a low vote, so I should comment. It was obvious that it was a nightlight or air freshener or something, and the pattern was fine, but it was also scuzzy dirty, which I found to be more disgusting than interesting. Hence the vote. Sorry.</td>', 'I know that you know what you''re doing, so I won''t try to second guess....but I gave it a low vote, so I should comment. It was obvious that it was a nightlight or air freshener or something, and the pattern was fine, but it was also scuzzy dirty, which I found to be more disgusting than interesting. Hence the vote. Sorry.', '2007-01-04 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 0),
