(3184351, 441785, 12200, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I had this one in my top three for the challenge. I think the composition of this web shot is just so very striking and original.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I had this one in my top three for the challenge. I think the composition of this web shot is just so very striking and original.', '2007-01-05 09:17:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184730, 442660, 70270, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes ... I was very pleased with the results for my first challenge.  I didn''t expect to do this well with an understated image that lacked much color and pop ... the 8s 9s and 10s are very humbling, and much appreciated (along with the rest).  Its inspiring to see your images touch others.  Thanks.<br/> <br/>As for Team Pentax ... bring it on!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes ... I was very pleased with the results for my first challenge.  I didn''t expect to do this well with an understated image that lacked much color and pop ... the 8s 9s and 10s are very humbling, and much appreciated (along with the rest).  Its inspiring to see your images touch others.  Thanks. As for Team Pentax ... bring it on!', '2007-01-05 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184732, 443026, 64733, '<td valign="top">i thought this shot would have done better with the bottom 1/3 cropped off.  the dynamics of the light against the wrapper on the top 2/3 are less stimulating against the "dullness" of the bottom.  a bit more post-processing to emphasize the brilliance of the wrappers would have helped too.  <br/> <br/>i do think this was better than your 5.11 score, tho...</td>', 'i thought this shot would have done better with the bottom 1/3 cropped off.  the dynamics of the light against the wrapper on the top 2/3 are less stimulating against the "dullness" of the bottom.  a bit more post-processing to emphasize the brilliance of the wrappers would have helped too.   i do think this was better than your 5.11 score, tho...', '2007-01-05 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3184775, 443014, 64733, '<td valign="top">i wish the background could be even MORE prominent, to emphasize the intersection of the patterns by both the subject and the paper.  the color is great.</td>', 'i wish the background could be even MORE prominent, to emphasize the intersection of the patterns by both the subject and the paper.  the color is great.', '2007-01-05 12:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
