(3208576, 442366, 48890, '<td valign="top">Yes, you need the top part for precisely the reason you gave.  This is a great choice of subject.  What I don''t like here is (1) lack of an accent (the pattern itself is not an accent, there must be a "raisin" in the bun), and (2) the elongated format of the image.<br/> <br/>I can see that you are having fun with your new DSLR; this had a long way coming, good luck with that! :)</td>', 'Yes, you need the top part for precisely the reason you gave.  This is a great choice of subject.  What I don''t like here is (1) lack of an accent (the pattern itself is not an accent, there must be a "raisin" in the bun), and (2) the elongated format of the image. I can see that you are having fun with your new DSLR; this had a long way coming, good luck with that! :)', '2007-01-10 18:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3210336, 443003, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful composition. It breaks some of the traditional rules (head/feet cut off), but actually works for the better I think. Nice tonal range. Alas though I have feeling most of the low scores was the lack of impact on the pattern. I think it is great myself, but there is always a set notion with voters.</td>', 'This is a wonderful composition. It breaks some of the traditional rules (head/feet cut off), but actually works for the better I think. Nice tonal range. Alas though I have feeling most of the low scores was the lack of impact on the pattern. I think it is great myself, but there is always a set notion with voters.', '2007-01-11 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
