(3277536, 442540, 56797, '<td valign="top">this is done very well actually. great detail and colors, focus, lines. all of that is good. I dig it. I assume what happened here is just lack of wow factor. maybe in comparison to some other shots in the challenge. It''s a technically great shot. It just lacks emotion or anything like that to grab the viewers attention. I would however expect something like this to score higher in general. 5.5 at least. I''m not sure what happened here.</td>', 'this is done very well actually. great detail and colors, focus, lines. all of that is good. I dig it. I assume what happened here is just lack of wow factor. maybe in comparison to some other shots in the challenge. It''s a technically great shot. It just lacks emotion or anything like that to grab the viewers attention. I would however expect something like this to score higher in general. 5.5 at least. I''m not sure what happened here.', '2007-01-24 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
