(3376702, 442737, 60770, '<td valign="top">Isn''t the color a little salmon, no pun intended? I don''t know if it is what you intended, but the color of the ice is quite unsettling. The photo is great though.</td>', 'Isn''t the color a little salmon, no pun intended? I don''t know if it is what you intended, but the color of the ice is quite unsettling. The photo is great though.', '2007-02-17 23:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
